<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>A Journey of Grace | PNW Road Trip Blog</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Georgia, serif;
        }

        :root {
            --pnw-forest: #2D3E2E;
            --pnw-ocean: #4A6C6F;
            --pnw-sage: #98A087;
            --pnw-sky: #D4E0E7;
            --pnw-cream: #F8F7F4;
            --text-dark: #2c2c2c;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--pnw-cream);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .blog-hero {
            width: 100%;
            height: 420px;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.22), rgba(0,0,0,0.22)), url('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/abigail19/A.Lang/master/images/helen.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .blog-hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .blog-hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.92;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 920px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3.5rem 2rem;
        }

        .blog-main-image {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
            margin: 1rem 0 3rem;
        }

        .article-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: var(--pnw-forest);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .subscribe-section {
            background-color: var(--pnw-forest);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3.2rem 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .subscribe-section h2 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .subscribe-section p {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .subscribe-section input {
            width: min(350px, 90%);
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .subscribe-section button {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            background: var(--pnw-sage);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .subscribe-section button:hover {
            background: var(--pnw-ocean);
        }

        footer {
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        @media(max-width:768px){
            .blog-hero h1{
                font-size: 1.9rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <section class="blog-hero">
        <h1>Pacific Northwest Road Trip Journal</h1>
        <p>Reflections, Faith & Scenic Wanderings</p>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="article-title">A Journey of Grace by Abigail LANG</h2>
          <img class="image" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/abigail19/A.Lang/master/images/bayarea.png" alt="A Journey of Grace Article">
        <img class="blog-main-image" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/abigail19/A.Lang/master/images/helen.jpg" alt="A Journey of Grace Article">

    </div>

    <section class="subscribe-section">
        <h2>Follow My Travel & Faith Journey</h2>
        <p>Subscribe to receive future road trip journals, travel reflections, and new blog updates directly to your inbox.</p>
        <form>
            <input type="email" placeholder="Your email address" required>
            <br>
            <button type="submit">Subscribe Now</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>Pacific Northwest Road Trip Blog | Abigail LANG</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
